        "knowledge_point": "Calculating the Number of Ways That N Objects Can Be Arranged",
        "problem": "Suppose that $5$ pictures are to be hung from left to right in a hallway. In how many possible ways can they be hung?",
        "worked_solution": "There are $n=5$ pictures, so the number of possible arrangements is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5! & =5\\times 4\\times 3\\times 2\\times 1 \\\\  & =120.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, there are $120$ ways of arranging the $5$ pictures.",
